    "created_at": "2025-01-24T05:13:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-24T05:13:51Z",
    "body": "It's a good point that `instanceof` checks would still work. `.constructor` and `.constructor.name` checks would break, but hopefully everyone is doing `.name` checks...\n\nIt might be a slightly hard sell to take on compat risk, but maybe it's worth trying.",
