    "updated_at": "2025-01-27T07:49:19Z",
    "body": "I've put up a proposal for upgrading `QuotaExceededError` at https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/pull/1465. Thanks @bakkot for the push.\n\nI haven't yet discussed it within Chromium to see if we're ready to officially stand behind it, but at least people can see what it looks like. I personally think it's a good idea and will report back.",
